OL,3,GNEWSAWhy are we seeing more roadworks
OL,4,Aon major roads?
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour months of repairs are about to
OL,7,Fbegin at one of the West of England's
OL,8,Fbusiest motorway junctions, with
OL,9,Fsignificant delays expected.
OL,11,FNational Highways is set to carry out
OL,12,Fresurfacing and structural repairs at
OL,13,Fthe M4/M5 Almondsbury Interchange,
OL,14,Falongside the installation of new
OL,15,Finfrastructure, from 11 October until
OL,16,FFebruary.
OL,18,FThe work is expected to cause
OL,19,Fsignificant delays at peak times, with
OL,20,Fslip roads and sections of the
OL,21,Fcarriageway closing in phases.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
