OL,3,GNEWSAWhy are we seeing more roadworks
OL,4,Aon major roads?
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt the same time, repairs and
OL,7,Fimprovement works are being carried out
OL,8,Fon St George's Bridge on the M5 near
OL,9,FWeston-super-Mare, and both the A350
OL,10,Fand A36.
